      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FEMME (8) was drawn the middle last start but pinged the lids and recorded an all-the-way win (19.57) at Q Lakeside in a Maiden over 352m. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to go past. HARA'S LUCY (3) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Nangar Dixie (30.29) in a Grade 6. Stalked the pace but found the line strongly. Expected to be in this for a long way. BAGLESS BRUTE (2) box seated early before forging to the lead turning and lifting to score (29.85) at this track in a Maiden over 520m. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. HEATED RIVALRY (1) was strongly supported last start but missed the frame when fourth (30.44), beaten 4.5 lengths. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from four starts.",
